SQL SELECT Basics — Quick Revision Notes
The SELECT statement reads data from a table. Full coding skeleton: SELECT → DISTINCT → TOP → columns/aggregates → FROM → WHERE → GROUP BY → HAVING → ORDER BY You code it in one order, SQL runs it in another — see section 9️⃣ (this is the #1 source of bugs).

